<title>MALAYSIA: Perbadanan Fima suspended pending news.</title>
<headline>Perbadanan Fima suspended pending news.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of palm oil firm Ladang Perbadanan Fima Bhd was suspended from Monday trading pending a news announcement, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded on Friday at 5.95 ringgit.</p>
